## 4. User Roles

Single admin role for this project (confirmed simple scope — no multi-role/permission matrix needed):

| Role | Description |
|---|---|
| `admin` | Full unrestricted access to the CMS. Only role in the system. |

- `App\Http\Middleware\AdminMiddleware` protects all `/admin/*` routes
- No public user accounts exist — visitors are anonymous; leads are captured via the contact form only

