## 9. Layouts

### `AppLayout.vue`
Public pages. Includes `<Navbar>`, `<slot>`, `<Footer>`. Handles `dir="rtl"` automatically based on current locale's `direction`.

### `AuthLayout.vue`
Admin login only. Split layout — dark cork-brown brand panel with logo, right-side login form.

### `AdminLayout.vue`
All `/admin/*` pages. Includes `<AdminSidebar>`, `<AdminTopBar>`, `<slot>`. Sidebar collapse state via `useLocalStorage`.

