## 10. SEO Strategy

- Every public page sets meta tags via `<Head>` from `@inertiajs/vue3`, using the current locale's `meta_title`/`meta_description` from the relevant translation row, falling back to `site_settings` global defaults
- Title template: `{page_title} | {site_name}`
- `sitemap.xml` generated per locale, regenerated on publish/update of any translatable content
- `robots.txt` served dynamically from `site_settings.robots_txt`
- All public URLs use locale-specific slugs, never IDs
- Post-deployment: connect Google Analytics (ID from settings), Google Search Console (verification meta tag from settings), submit the generated sitemap
- Structured data (JSON-LD) for Organization + individual Projects/Articles, to support both traditional search and AI-driven search surfaces

